+test('Grouped tasks fail closed; missing group tables after DB restore are supported',async()=>{const f=fixture();f.groupObject=true;f.groupMember=true;for(const method of ['complete','edit']){const h=await setup(f);await assert.rejects(method==='complete'?h.api.completeTask(202):h.api.saveTaskEdit(202,edit()),expected('GROUP_STATUS_NOT_READY'));assert.equal(h.writes.length,0);}const h=await setup();assert.equal((await h.api.completeTask(202)).Complited,1);});
